# Every checkout gets the committed bytes, LF, whatever the machine's
# core.autocrlf: release builds embed files (include_str!) and must embed
# the same bytes on every platform. 2.33.0's Windows installers embedded a
# CRLF schema_1.sql and couldn't start on an upgraded PC.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The BSB's raw sources, byte for byte as Berean publishes them, CRLF
# and all (see sources/bsb/README.md). Never convert their line endings.
sources/bsb/bsb.txt -text
sources/bsb/bsb_usfm.zip binary

# The KJV's raw source, byte for byte as eBible.org publishes it, and the
# 2.29.1 file's verses it replaced, exactly (see sources/kjv/README.md).
sources/kjv/eng-kjv2006_usfm.zip binary
sources/kjv/kjv_2_29_1_replaced.tsv -text
